  "citation": "Grande E (2022): Subsurface redox potential and water level at the Elkhorn Slough NERR. Linking Nutrient Reactivity and Transport in Subsurface Flowpaths Along a Terrestrial-Estuarine Continuum. Dataset. doi:10.15485/1846282",
  "dataset": {
