    "measurementTechnique": [
      "Water level and water temperature were measured in-situ with Solinst pressure transducer loggers (Ontario, Canada). Measurements were recorded at 5min intervals and averaged to hourly for computational simplicity.\nRedox potential was collected using in-situ, redox sensors (Paleoterra, The Netherlands) connected to CR1000X Campbell data loggers (Logan, Utah). Redox measurements were recorded at 1 min intervals. Similar to other data, these time series were also averaged to hourly intervals.\nWe calculated the variance over the course of the study period for the Eh and water level time series to control for measurement drifts.\nMeteorological data was gathered from the Elkhorn Slough meteorological station."
    ],
